    7:     text: 'Namaste! I am Aruvi (அருவி), your living cultural guide on HERITAGE 360. My name means "sacred cascading stream" in Tamil. I am here to unravel the wisdom, science, architecture, and living folklore woven across India\'s five thousand years of civilizational heritage. How may I enlighten your journey today?',
    8:     timestamp: 'Just now',
    9:     verifiedSource: {
   10:       org: 'Ministry of Culture & Indira Gandhi National Centre for the Arts (IGNCA)',
