   327:     audioGreetingText: 'Namaskaram! Welcome to God’s Own Country, of sacred groves, Theyyam rituals, Ayurvedic treatises, and the rhythm of Kathakali drums.',
   328:     summary: 'A tropical maritime haven known for UNESCO-recognized Sanskrit theatre Kudiyattam, incandescent Theyyam spirit possession rituals, and pristine backwaters.',
